00:10:19,353 --> 00:10:23,357
About 50 feet up.
Okay, back up and push.

258
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:24,825
Uh-oh.

259
00:10:24,858 --> 00:10:28,028
A spectacular cascade
of alka seltzer.

260
00:10:28,062 --> 00:10:30,965
I can't believe gamera
ate the whole thing.

261
00:10:30,998 --> 00:10:33,000
He ate it, ralph.

262
00:10:33,033 --> 00:10:35,402
Look, water,
the source of all--

263
00:10:35,435 --> 00:10:37,972
we know. We know.

264
00:10:41,208 --> 00:10:42,242
Ooh.

265
00:10:42,275 --> 00:10:44,145
Gamera loves flames.

266
00:10:44,178 --> 00:10:45,680
But they go straight
to his hips.

267
00:10:45,713 --> 00:10:47,515
He left japan as suddenly
as he had arrived,

268
00:10:47,548 --> 00:10:49,983
and headed for mount uzal
and the equator,

269
00:10:50,017 --> 00:10:52,920
flying directly toward
the flowing molten lava.

270
00:10:52,953 --> 00:10:55,222
He had a contract
with wham-o.

271
00:10:55,288 --> 00:10:56,290
Hmm.

272
00:10:56,290 --> 00:10:57,392
When in cleveland,

273
00:10:57,425 --> 00:10:58,958
visit the golden dragon inn,

274
00:10:58,992 --> 00:11:00,728
only 15 minutes
from our cinema.

275
00:11:00,762 --> 00:11:02,295
And now back to our film--

276
00:11:02,328 --> 00:11:04,165
sky king,
the motion picture.

277
00:11:08,302 --> 00:11:11,338
Tell me, are you really
going to resign?

278
00:11:11,372 --> 00:11:14,475
Yeah.
This is my last day up here.

279
00:11:14,508 --> 00:11:16,143
I will serve my master
down there.

280
00:11:16,177 --> 00:11:17,378
But you've just
earned your wings

281
00:11:17,412 --> 00:11:18,412
