1222
00:46:53,312 --> 00:46:54,680
Uh, oh,
that figure of speech.

1223
00:46:54,713 --> 00:46:56,382
Metaphor. Ha. Teasing.

1224
00:46:56,415 --> 00:46:57,582
You killed them both?

1225
00:46:57,615 --> 00:46:59,317
Well,
not at the same time.

1226
00:46:59,350 --> 00:47:01,152
